<title>USA: Peoples Bank Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Peoples Bank Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ending December 31,</p>
<p>					    1996	  1995</p>
<p> Net interest income		 $4,872     $4,262</p>
<p> Provision for loan losses	    375	   75</p>
<p> Non - interest income		1,390	1,206</p>
<p> Non - interest expense	     3,839	3,528</p>
<p> Net income			     1,401	1,310</p>
<p> Earnings per share		    0.88	 0.82</p>
<p>		 ($000's except where indicated)</p>
<p>				     Twelve months Ending December 31,</p>
<p>					     1996	 1995</p>
<p> Net interest income		 18,302     16,165</p>
<p> Provision for loan losses	  1,125	  536</p>
<p> Non-interest income		  5,342	4,868</p>
<p> Non-interest expense		14,793     15,316</p>
<p> Net income			     5,409	3,886</p>
<p> Earnings per share		    3.44	 2.44</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding    1,584,255  1,595,322</p>
<p>	     ($000's except where indicated)</p>
<p>NOTE:</p>
<p>    Assets   $471.5 million vs $417.0 million</p>
<p>Loans (includes held for sale)</p>
<p>		 $333.4 million vs $273.7 million</p>
<p>Deposits $411.8 million vs $351.8 million</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is Peoples Bank Corp of Indianapolis.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
